SD_MAP01_EXIT_TEXT = "Zarya-7 is yours again.\n\nThe service lift drops into the dark,\npast the last lit level, and keeps\ngoing. Under the cosmodrome runs a\nmetro line, dug deep for the next war.\n\nThe invaders found it first.\nYou follow them down.";
// Cluster 4 (D62): leaving MAP02 for MAP03, out of the metro's westbound
// tunnel at the tractor works' goods spur. From level-designer's draft
// (docs/levels/MAP03-factory.md 11), with the map's name added.
SD_MAP02_EXIT_TEXT = "The westbound tunnel climbs into\ndaylight at a goods spur.\n\nBeyond the buffers stand the sheds\nof a tractor works. The tracks in\nthe yard are too wide for tractors.\n\nThe workers have a name for it:\nTankograd.";
// Cluster 1: the end of the episode, shown when the campaign's last map is
// left. It closed MAP01 until D60 ("The gantry lights go out behind
// you..."), the metro until D62 ("The bunker lights go out behind you...");
