SD_END01_TEXT = "The breaker drops. Behind you the\nportal shrinks to a point of light\nand goes out.\n\nTankograd is yours again: the line\nstands still, and nothing more\ncomes through.\n\nThose already through are marching\nwest, to Moscow.\n\nTO BE CONTINUED";
